import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 758 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Democratic Consultation Mechanism for Law Revision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 758 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Democratic Consultation Mechanism for Law Revision","no":758,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules","Law Revision","Democratic Consultation","Republican of Myriad Races","Anchor Council"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","40-Symbiotic Constitution Overview","48-Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0758_模块4-超多元级规则-法则修订民主协商.md","filePath":"en/0758_模块4-超多元级规则-法则修订民主协商.md"}'),o={name:"en/0758_模块4-超多元级规则-法则修订民主协商.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-758-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-the-democratic-consultation-mechanism-for-law-revision" tabindex="-1">Entry 758 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Democratic Consultation Mechanism for Law Revision <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-758-hyper-multiverse-grade-rules-the-democratic-consultation-mechanism-for-law-revision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 758 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Rules | The Democratic Consultation Mechanism for Law Revision&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 40, 48</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-old-rules-not-revised-are-civilization-s-shackles" tabindex="-1">Introduction: old rules not revised are civilization&#39;s shackles <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-old-rules-not-revised-are-civilization-s-shackles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: old rules not revised are civilization&#39;s shackles&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The law network needs infinite scalability, and also needs continuous revision. Laws set in one era may no longer apply in the next. Without a revision mechanism, the law network accumulates more and more rigidity, finally becoming civilization&#39;s shackles. Old web novels are full of such examples — the &quot;Heavenly Dao&quot; set in ancient times still runs in the Dharma-Ending Age, suppressing all new things as &quot;defying Heaven.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution is to establish a democratic consultation mechanism for law revision.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are the revision mechanism&#39;s skeleton: the anti-predation axiom requires revision not protect predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the revision process have Myriad-Rank participation; the collective ascension axiom requires revision serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires revision not cause historical reversal; the law-first axiom requires revised laws still be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-when-revision-is-needed" tabindex="-1">I. When Revision Is Needed <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-when-revision-is-needed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. When Revision Is Needed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law revision is usually triggered by four kinds of triggering events:</p><ol><li><strong>Environmental change</strong>: plane parameter changes (spirit-energy density, astral cycles) cause old laws to no longer apply;</li><li><strong>Technological progress</strong>: new technology (such as law-weaving) makes some clauses of old laws obsolete;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank feedback</strong>: Myriad Ranks discover holes or unfairness in old laws during use;</li><li><strong>Alaya audit</strong>: Alaya Network self-consistency audit discovers contradictions in old laws.</li></ol><p>Any one triggering event may start the revision process.</p><h2 id="ii-the-four-level-revision-procedure" tabindex="-1">II. The Four-Level Revision Procedure <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-four-level-revision-procedure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Four-Level Revision Procedure&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Revision Content</th><th>Passage Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Level 1</td><td>Operation-level rule revision</td><td>Department committee approval</td></tr><tr><td>Level 2</td><td>Department-level law revision</td><td>Anchor Council vote</td></tr><tr><td>Level 3</td><td>Charter-level law revision</td><td>Myriad-Rank Representatives&#39; Assembly 2/3 passage</td></tr><tr><td>Level 4</td><td>Meta-law revision</td><td>Forbidden — meta-laws may not be revised</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The four-level procedure ensures: minor tweaks are fast and flexible; major overhauls are cautious and democratic; core principles are unshakable.</p><h2 id="iii-the-democratic-consultation-process" tabindex="-1">III. The Democratic Consultation Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-democratic-consultation-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Democratic Consultation Process&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Taking Level 2 revision (department-level laws) as an example, the complete process is:</p><ol><li><strong>Proposal</strong>: any cultivator, any race, any Alaya Network node may propose a revision proposal;</li><li><strong>Publicity</strong>: the proposal is publicized network-wide, accepting Myriad-Rank comments and revision suggestions;</li><li><strong>Hearing</strong>: the Anchor Council organizes a hearing; relevant racial representatives speak;</li><li><strong>Revision</strong>: revise the proposal per hearing opinions;</li><li><strong>Vote</strong>: the Council votes; majority passes;</li><li><strong>Trial operation</strong>: trial-run one cycle, collecting feedback;</li><li><strong>Formal effective</strong>: after trial-run succeeds, formally effective.</li></ol><p>The whole process is transparent throughout; records are all filed.</p><h2 id="iv-revision-and-historical-continuity" tabindex="-1">IV. Revision and Historical Continuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-revision-and-historical-continuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Revision and Historical Continuity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Revising laws does not equal overturning and starting over. Heng Yuan Zhou has two principles guaranteeing historical continuity:</p><ul><li><strong>No retroactivity</strong>: new laws do not trace past actions, only bind the future;</li><li><strong>Version archiving</strong>: every law&#39;s historical versions are all preserved, archaeology and legal tracing may all query.</li></ul><p>This ensures revision is &quot;forward-looking,&quot; not &quot;old-account-settling.&quot;</p><p>Regular revision goes through the seven-step process, but civilization does not always play by regular rules. When some plane suffers law-level mutation, predatory-faction remnants cross-cosmos infiltrate, or Alaya audit discovers an emergency contradiction, Heng Yuan Zhou allows an &quot;emergency revision channel&quot; to be opened: the proposer directly petitions an emergency session of the Anchor Council; hearing and voting complete within 24 shichen; the vote threshold rises from majority to two-thirds; and passage must be followed by three cycles of trial operation, with Myriad-Rank Representatives&#39; Assembly ratification before formalization. The emergency channel exists to prevent &quot;going through procedure until civilization has already had an accident,&quot; but the high threshold and ratification mechanism prevent its abuse into &quot;using the name of emergency to practice autocracy.&quot; Minority protection is equally key: if a revision vote involves some ethnic group&#39;s core cultural rights, that ethnic group holds a &quot;cultural veto&quot; — even if the Myriad-Rank Assembly passes by two-thirds, as long as the affected ethnic group&#39;s representatives&#39; assembly vetoes, the revision may not be forcefully landed on that ethnic group&#39;s plane.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a law network without a revision mechanism accumulates more and more rigidity, continuously wasting computable power; democratic consultation keeps laws always adapted to reality</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the revision mechanism allows Myriad Ranks to revise old laws protecting predation, institutionally continuously anti-predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s law revision is Gu Chensha&#39;s single decision; Heng Yuan Zhou is proposal, publicity, hearing, vote, trial-run</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the revision process is open to Myriad Ranks; every race may propose, attend hearings, and vote</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: revision process, revision records, and revision results are all public network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The democratic consultation mechanism for law revision is the institutional guarantee that makes the law network &quot;living.&quot; Old rules must be replaceable by new rules, otherwise civilization will be trapped by its own past. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s revision mechanism is not &quot;change at will,&quot; but &quot;change cautiously, change openly, change together with Myriad Ranks.&quot;</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/40-共生宪法总纲.html">Entry 40 · Symbiotic Constitution Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/48-司法体系与裁决机制.html">Entry 48 · Judicial System and Adjudication Mechanism</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const v=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,v as default};
